"""Cybersecurity glossary, part 25: gap-fill found by a coverage audit against a standard term checklist (foundations, access control, forensics, attack techniques,
personal protection, AI and crypto security, law). Same row format as part 1. fr/rw/sw wording is a draft for review by fluent speakers; technical words people usually keep in English are kept."""

TERMS_25 = [
 ("confidentiality", "Confidentiality", ["confidentiality", "confidentialité", "confidentialite", "ibanga ry'amakuru", "usiri wa taarifa", "keeping data secret"], "foundations", "confidential documents lock",
  {"fr": "Confidentialité", "sw": "Usiri wa taarifa", "rw": "Ibanga ry'amakuru"},
  "The security goal that information can be read only by people who are allowed to. It is the first letter of the CIA triad (confidentiality, integrity, availability).",
  "Protected by encryption, access control, strong logins and careful sharing. Breaking it causes a data leak, for example a customer list read by strangers.",
  "L'objectif de sécurité qui garantit que l'information n'est lisible que par les personnes autorisées. C'est la première lettre de la triade CIA (confidentialité, intégrité, disponibilité).",
  "Protégée par le chiffrement, le contrôle d'accès, des connexions solides et un partage prudent. La rompre provoque une fuite de données, par exemple une liste de clients lue par des inconnus.",
  "Ni intego y'umutekano ivuga ko amakuru asomwa gusa n'abayemerewe. Ni inyuguti ya mbere ya CIA triad (confidentiality, integrity, availability).",
  "Irindwa na encryption, kugenzura uburenganzira, kwinjira bikomeye no gusangiza amakuru witonze. Iyo ivunitse havuka kumeneka kw'amakuru, urugero urutonde rw'abakiriya rusomwe n'abatazi.",
  "Lengo la usalama kwamba taarifa zisomwe tu na watu walioruhusiwa. Ni herufi ya kwanza ya CIA triad (confidentiality, integrity, availability).",
  "Hulindwa kwa usimbaji, udhibiti wa ufikiaji, kuingia kwa nguvu na kushiriki kwa uangalifu. Ikivunjwa husababisha uvujaji wa data, mfano orodha ya wateja kusomwa na wageni."),
 ("integrity", "Integrity", ["integrity", "data integrity", "intégrité", "integrite", "intégrité des données", "ubusugire bw'amakuru", "uadilifu wa data"], "foundations", "digital signature checksum",
  {"fr": "Intégrité", "sw": "Uadilifu wa data", "rw": "Ubusugire bw'amakuru"},
  "The security goal that information stays correct and is not changed by anyone who should not change it, accidentally or on purpose.",
  "Protected by hashes, digital signatures, backups and access control. Breaking it means altered records, for example a changed bank account number on an invoice.",
  "L'objectif de sécurité qui garantit que l'information reste exacte et n'est pas modifiée par quelqu'un qui n'y est pas autorisé, par accident ou volontairement.",
  "Protégée par les hachages, signatures numériques, sauvegardes et contrôle d'accès. La rompre donne des données altérées, par exemple un numéro de compte modifié sur une facture.",
  "Ni intego y'umutekano ivuga ko amakuru akomeza kuba ukuri kandi ntahindurwe n'utabyemerewe, ku bw'impanuka cyangwa ku bushake.",
  "Irindwa na hashes, digital signatures, backups no kugenzura uburenganzira. Iyo ivunitse amakuru arahinduka, urugero nimero ya konti ihinduwe kuri fagitire.",
  "Lengo la usalama kwamba taarifa zibaki sahihi na hazibadilishwi na asiyeruhusiwa, kwa bahati mbaya au kwa makusudi.",
  "Hulindwa kwa hash, saini za kidijitali, nakala rudufu na udhibiti wa ufikiaji. Ikivunjwa rekodi hubadilishwa, mfano nambari ya akaunti iliyobadilishwa kwenye ankara."),
 ("availability", "Availability", ["availability", "disponibilité", "disponibilite", "kuboneka kw'amakuru", "upatikanaji wa huduma", "uptime"], "foundations", "data center servers",
  {"fr": "Disponibilité", "sw": "Upatikanaji", "rw": "Kuboneka kwa serivisi n'amakuru"},
  "The security goal that systems and data are usable when people need them. Attacks such as DDoS and ransomware target availability.",
  "Protected by backups, spare systems, power and internet redundancy, patching and DDoS protection. A bank website that is down for a day has lost availability.",
  "L'objectif de sécurité qui garantit que systèmes et données sont utilisables quand on en a besoin. Les attaques DDoS et les rançongiciels visent la disponibilité.",
  "Protégée par les sauvegardes, systèmes de secours, redondance d'électricité et d'internet, correctifs et protection DDoS. Un site bancaire hors service un jour perd en disponibilité.",
  "Ni intego y'umutekano ivuga ko sisitemu n'amakuru bikoreshwa igihe bikenewe. Ibitero nka DDoS na ransomware bigamije kubangamira kuboneka.",
  "Irindwa na backups, sisitemu z'inyongera, amashanyarazi na interineti by'ubundi buryo, patches na DDoS protection. Urubuga rwa banki rumaze umunsi rudakora rwatakaje kuboneka.",
  "Lengo la usalama kwamba mifumo na data zinatumika zinapohitajika. Mashambulizi kama DDoS na ransomware hulenga upatikanaji.",
  "Hulindwa kwa nakala rudufu, mifumo mbadala, umeme na intaneti mbadala, masasisho na ulinzi wa DDoS. Tovuti ya benki isiyofanya kazi siku nzima imepoteza upatikanaji."),
 ("hacker", "Hacker", ["hacker", "hackers", "cracker", "pirate informatique", "umuhacker", "mdukuzi", "hacker types", "who is a hacker"], "people", "programmer laptop code",
  {"fr": "Pirate informatique / hacker", "sw": "Mdukuzi (hacker)", "rw": "Umuhacker"},
  "A person who uses technical skill to explore or get into computer systems. The word covers ethical hackers who help defend (white hat), criminals who attack for gain (black hat) and people in between (grey hat).",
  "In the news the word usually means a criminal, but many hackers are security professionals hired to find weaknesses legally. What matters is permission: testing a system without permission is illegal.",
  "Personne qui utilise des compétences techniques pour explorer des systèmes informatiques ou y entrer. Le mot couvre les hackers éthiques qui aident à défendre (white hat), les criminels qui attaquent pour gagner de l'argent (black hat) et les cas intermédiaires (grey hat).",
  "Dans les médias le mot désigne souvent un criminel, mais beaucoup de hackers sont des professionnels engagés pour trouver des failles légalement. Ce qui compte, c'est l'autorisation : tester un système sans permission est illégal.",
  "Umuntu ukoresha ubumenyi bwa tekiniki mu gusuzuma cyangwa kwinjira muri sisitemu za mudasobwa. Iri jambo rikubiyemo aba hackers b'imyitwarire myiza bafasha kurinda (white hat), abagizi ba nabi bagamije inyungu (black hat) n'abari hagati (grey hat).",
  "Mu makuru iri jambo rikunze kuvuga umugizi wa nabi, ariko hackers benshi ni abanyamwuga bahabwa akazi ko gushaka intege nke mu buryo bwemewe. Icy'ingenzi ni uruhushya: kugerageza sisitemu nta ruhushya binyuranyije n'amategeko.",
  "Mtu anayetumia ujuzi wa kiufundi kuchunguza au kuingia kwenye mifumo ya kompyuta. Neno hili linajumuisha wadukuzi wenye maadili wanaosaidia kulinda (white hat), wahalifu wanaoshambulia kwa faida (black hat) na walio katikati (grey hat).",
  "Kwenye habari neno hili mara nyingi humaanisha mhalifu, lakini wadukuzi wengi ni wataalamu wanaoajiriwa kutafuta udhaifu kihalali. Kinachojalisha ni idhini: kujaribu mfumo bila idhini ni kinyume cha sheria."),
 ("access-control-list", "Access control list (ACL)", ["access control list", "acl", "acls", "liste de contrôle d'accès", "liste de controle d'acces", "urutonde rw'uburenganzira", "orodha ya udhibiti wa ufikiaji"], "identity", "file permissions settings",
  {"fr": "Liste de contrôle d'accès (ACL)", "sw": "Orodha ya udhibiti wa ufikiaji (ACL)", "rw": "Urutonde rw'uburenganzira (ACL)"},
  "A list attached to a file, folder, router or system that says who or what is allowed to do which action (read, write, run, connect) and who is blocked.",
  "Used in file servers, network routers and firewalls. Good practice: allow only what is needed, review the list regularly and remove people who have left.",
  "Liste associée à un fichier, dossier, routeur ou système qui indique qui ou quoi a le droit de faire quelle action (lire, écrire, exécuter, se connecter) et qui est bloqué.",
  "Utilisée dans les serveurs de fichiers, routeurs et pare-feu. Bonne pratique : n'autoriser que le nécessaire, relire la liste régulièrement et retirer les personnes parties.",
  "Urutonde rufatanye na dosiye, ububiko, router cyangwa sisitemu rwerekana uwemerewe gukora igikorwa (gusoma, kwandika, gukoresha, guhuza) n'uwahagaritswe.",
  "Rukoreshwa muri seriveri za dosiye, routers na firewalls. Imikorere myiza: wemera gusa ibikenewe, ugasubiramo urutonde buri gihe ukavanamo abagiye.",
  "Orodha iliyoambatishwa kwenye faili, folda, router au mfumo inayoonyesha nani anaruhusiwa kufanya kitendo gani (kusoma, kuandika, kuendesha, kuunganisha) na nani amezuiwa.",
  "Hutumika kwenye seva za faili, routers na firewalls. Mazoea mazuri: ruhusu kinachohitajika tu, pitia orodha mara kwa mara na uondoe walioondoka."),
 ("discretionary-access-control", "Discretionary access control (DAC)", ["discretionary access control", "dac", "contrôle d'accès discrétionnaire", "controle d'acces discretionnaire", "owner decides access"], "identity", "folder sharing permissions",
  {"fr": "Contrôle d'accès discrétionnaire (DAC)", "sw": "Udhibiti wa ufikiaji wa hiari (DAC)", "rw": "Kugenzura uburenganzira bwemezwa na nyir'ikintu (DAC)"},
  "An access model where the owner of a file or resource decides who else may use it, for example sharing a document with chosen colleagues.",
  "Common in everyday tools (shared folders, cloud documents). It is flexible but can lead to over-sharing, so organisations add rules such as RBAC or mandatory access control for sensitive data.",
  "Modèle d'accès où le propriétaire d'un fichier ou d'une ressource décide qui d'autre peut l'utiliser, par exemple en partageant un document avec des collègues choisis.",
  "Courant dans les outils quotidiens (dossiers partagés, documents cloud). Souple mais source de sur-partage ; les organisations ajoutent donc du RBAC ou du contrôle d'accès obligatoire pour les données sensibles.",
  "Ni uburyo bw'uburenganzira aho nyir'idosiye cyangwa icyo gikoresho yemeza abandi bashobora kugikoresha, urugero asangiza inyandiko n'abakozi yahisemo.",
  "Busanzwe mu bikoresho bya buri munsi (ububiko busangiwe, inyandiko muri cloud). Buroroshye ariko bushobora gutuma amakuru asangizwa cyane; ibigo rero byongeraho RBAC cyangwa mandatory access control ku makuru y'ingenzi.",
  "Mfano wa ufikiaji ambapo mmiliki wa faili au rasilimali anaamua nani mwingine anaweza kuitumia, mfano kushiriki hati na wenzake aliowachagua.",
  "Ni kawaida kwenye zana za kila siku (folda zilizoshirikiwa, hati za cloud). Ni rahisi lakini husababisha kushiriki kupita kiasi; mashirika huongeza RBAC au mandatory access control kwa data nyeti."),
 ("identity-provider", "Identity provider (IdP)", ["identity provider", "idp", "fournisseur d'identité", "fournisseur d'identite", "login with google", "sign in with google", "oauth login", "mtoa utambulisho"], "identity", "single sign on login screen",
  {"fr": "Fournisseur d'identité (IdP)", "sw": "Mtoa utambulisho (IdP)", "rw": "Utanga ukwemeza umwirondoro (IdP)"},
  "A trusted service that proves who you are to other apps, for example the system behind “Sign in with Google” or a company single sign-on portal.",
  "It lets you log in once and keeps the passwords in one well-protected place. Protect that one account with strong MFA, because it opens many doors.",
  "Service de confiance qui prouve qui vous êtes à d'autres applications, par exemple le système derrière « Se connecter avec Google » ou le portail d'authentification unique d'une entreprise.",
  "Il permet de se connecter une seule fois et garde les mots de passe en un seul endroit bien protégé. Protégez ce compte avec une MFA forte, car il ouvre beaucoup de portes.",
  "Ni serivisi yizewe yemeza abandi porogaramu uwo uri we, urugero sisitemu iri inyuma ya «Sign in with Google» cyangwa SSO y'ikigo.",
  "Igufasha kwinjira rimwe kandi ikabika amagambo y'ibanga ahantu hamwe harinzwe neza. Rinda iyo konti ukoresheje MFA ikomeye kuko ikingura inzugi nyinshi.",
  "Huduma inayoaminika inayothibitisha wewe ni nani kwa programu nyingine, mfano mfumo nyuma ya «Ingia kwa Google» au tovuti ya kuingia mara moja ya kampuni.",
  "Hukuwezesha kuingia mara moja na kuweka nywila mahali pamoja panapolindwa vizuri. Linda akaunti hiyo kwa MFA imara kwa sababu hufungua milango mingi."),
 ("service-account", "Service account", ["service account", "service accounts", "compte de service", "machine account", "non-human account", "konti ya serivisi", "akaunti ya huduma"], "identity", "server automation robot",
  {"fr": "Compte de service", "sw": "Akaunti ya huduma", "rw": "Konti ya serivisi"},
  "A non-human account used by an application, script or server to log in to other systems. Nobody types its password, so it is often forgotten and over-privileged.",
  "Attackers like service accounts because they rarely have MFA and keep powerful rights. Give each one the minimum rights, rotate its secrets and monitor how it is used.",
  "Compte non humain utilisé par une application, un script ou un serveur pour se connecter à d'autres systèmes. Personne ne tape son mot de passe, il est donc souvent oublié et sur-privilégié.",
  "Les attaquants les apprécient car ils n'ont presque jamais de MFA et gardent de grands droits. Donnez à chacun le minimum de droits, renouvelez ses secrets et surveillez son usage.",
  "Ni konti itari iy'umuntu ikoreshwa na porogaramu, script cyangwa seriveri mu kwinjira muri izindi sisitemu. Ntawe wandika ijambo ryayo ry'ibanga, bityo ikunze kwibagirana ikagira uburenganzira bwinshi.",
  "Abagizi ba nabi barazikunda kuko ntizifite MFA kenshi kandi zifite uburenganzira bukomeye. Haza buri imwe uburenganzira buto bushoboka, uhindure amabanga yayo kandi ukurikirane ikoreshwa ryayo.",
  "Akaunti isiyo ya binadamu inayotumiwa na programu, script au seva kuingia kwenye mifumo mingine. Hakuna anayeandika nywila yake, hivyo mara nyingi husahaulika na kuwa na haki nyingi.",
  "Wahalifu huipenda kwa sababu mara chache ina MFA na huhifadhi haki kubwa. Ipe kila moja haki ndogo kabisa, badilisha siri zake na ufuatilie matumizi yake."),
 ("authenticator-app", "Authenticator app", ["authenticator app", "authenticator", "google authenticator", "microsoft authenticator", "totp app", "application d'authentification", "porogaramu yemeza", "programu ya uthibitishaji"], "identity", "smartphone authentication code",
  {"fr": "Application d'authentification", "sw": "Programu ya uthibitishaji", "rw": "Porogaramu yo kwemeza (authenticator)"},
  "A phone app that generates a short code that changes every 30 seconds, used as the second step of two-step login (MFA).",
  "Safer than SMS codes because it cannot be taken by SIM swapping. Never read the code to anyone: a real service never asks for it, and a caller who does is a scammer.",
  "Application du téléphone qui génère un court code changeant toutes les 30 secondes, utilisé comme deuxième étape de la connexion en deux étapes (MFA).",
  "Plus sûre que les codes SMS car elle ne peut pas être volée par échange de SIM. Ne dictez jamais le code : un vrai service ne le demande pas, et un appelant qui le fait est un escroc.",
  "Ni porogaramu ya telefone ikora kode ngufi ihinduka buri masegonda 30, ikoreshwa nk'intambwe ya kabiri yo kwinjira (MFA).",
  "Itekanye kurusha kode za SMS kuko idashobora kwibwa binyuze kuri SIM swap. Ntuzigere uvuga kode: serivisi nyayo ntiyigera iyisaba, kandi uhamagaye uyisaba ni umutekamutwe.",
  "Programu ya simu inayounda msimbo mfupi unaobadilika kila sekunde 30, inayotumika kama hatua ya pili ya kuingia (MFA).",
  "Ni salama kuliko misimbo ya SMS kwa sababu haiwezi kuibwa kwa SIM swap. Kamwe usimsomee mtu msimbo: huduma halisi haiuombi, na mpigaji anayeuomba ni tapeli."),
 ("security-baseline", "Security baseline", ["security baseline", "baseline configuration", "secure configuration", "configuration baseline", "hardening standard", "cis benchmark", "cis benchmarks", "référentiel de sécurité", "umurongo ntarengwa w'umutekano", "kiwango cha msingi cha usalama"], "defense", "server configuration checklist",
  {"fr": "Référentiel de sécurité de base", "sw": "Kiwango cha msingi cha usalama", "rw": "Urwego rw'ibanze rw'umutekano"},
  "The minimum secure settings every device or server must have (for example no default passwords, unused services off, automatic updates on). Public benchmarks such as the CIS Benchmarks describe them.",
  "Used to set up new computers the same safe way and to spot drift when a setting is later changed. It is the foundation of system hardening.",
  "Les réglages de sécurité minimaux que tout appareil ou serveur doit avoir (par exemple pas de mots de passe par défaut, services inutiles coupés, mises à jour automatiques). Des référentiels publics comme les CIS Benchmarks les décrivent.",
  "Sert à installer les nouveaux ordinateurs de la même façon sûre et à repérer les dérives quand un réglage est modifié. C'est la base du durcissement des systèmes.",
  "Ni igenamiterere rya ngombwa ry'umutekano buri gikoresho cyangwa seriveri kigomba kugira (urugero nta jambo ry'ibanga ryo ku ruganda, serivisi zidakenewe zizimye, ivugurura ryikora rifunguye). Ibipimo rusange nka CIS Benchmarks biribisobanura.",
  "Rikoreshwa mu gutegura mudasobwa nshya zose kimwe kandi mu kubona igihe igenamiterere rihindutse. Ni ishingiro rya hardening.",
  "Mipangilio ya chini ya usalama ambayo kila kifaa au seva lazima iwe nayo (mfano hakuna nywila za kiwanda, huduma zisizotumika zimezimwa, masasisho ya kiotomatiki yamewashwa). Viwango vya wazi kama CIS Benchmarks huvieleza.",
  "Hutumika kusanidi kompyuta mpya kwa njia salama ile ile na kugundua mipangilio ikibadilika. Ni msingi wa hardening."),
 ("anti-forensics", "Anti-forensics", ["anti-forensics", "anti forensics", "anti-forensique", "covering tracks", "log tampering", "log deletion attack", "gusiba ibimenyetso", "kuficha athari"], "attacks", "deleted logs evidence",
  {"fr": "Anti-forensique", "sw": "Kuficha athari za kidijitali", "rw": "Gusiba ibimenyetso bya digitale"},
  "Actions an attacker takes to hide what they did or to slow an investigation, such as deleting logs, changing timestamps or wiping tools.",
  "Defenders answer by sending logs to a separate protected server, keeping read-only copies and watching for sudden log gaps, because a missing log is itself a warning sign.",
  "Actions d'un attaquant pour cacher ce qu'il a fait ou ralentir une enquête, comme supprimer des journaux, modifier des horodatages ou effacer des outils.",
  "Les défenseurs répondent en envoyant les journaux vers un serveur séparé et protégé, en gardant des copies en lecture seule et en surveillant les trous soudains, car un journal manquant est déjà un signal d'alerte.",
  "Ibikorwa umushimusi akora ngo ahishe ibyo yakoze cyangwa ahagarike iperereza, nko gusiba logs, guhindura igihe cyangwa gusiba ibikoresho.",
  "Abarinzi basubiza bohereza logs kuri seriveri itandukanye irinzwe, bagakomeza kopi zisomwa gusa kandi bakareba ibyuho bitunguranye, kuko log ibuze ubwayo ni ikimenyetso cy'ikibazo.",
  "Vitendo mshambulizi anavyofanya kuficha alichofanya au kupunguza kasi ya uchunguzi, kama kufuta kumbukumbu (logs), kubadilisha muda au kufuta zana.",
  "Walinzi hujibu kwa kutuma logs kwenye seva tofauti iliyolindwa, kuweka nakala za kusoma tu na kuangalia mapengo ya ghafla, kwa sababu log inayokosekana ni ishara ya hatari."),
 ("behavioral-analytics", "User and entity behaviour analytics (UEBA)", ["ueba", "user and entity behavior analytics", "user behaviour analytics", "behavioural analysis", "behavioral analysis", "anomaly detection", "analyse comportementale", "isesengura ry'imyitwarire", "uchambuzi wa tabia"], "operations", "security analytics dashboard",
  {"fr": "Analyse du comportement des utilisateurs (UEBA)", "sw": "Uchambuzi wa tabia za watumiaji (UEBA)", "rw": "Isesengura ry'imyitwarire y'abakoresha (UEBA)"},
  "Software that learns what normal activity looks like for each user and device and raises an alert when something unusual happens, such as a login from a new country at 3 a.m.",
  "It helps catch stolen accounts and insiders that rules alone miss. It can produce false alarms, so analysts check each alert before acting.",
  "Logiciel qui apprend l'activité normale de chaque utilisateur et appareil et alerte en cas d'événement inhabituel, comme une connexion depuis un nouveau pays à 3 h du matin.",
  "Il aide à repérer comptes volés et initiés malveillants que les règles seules manquent. Il peut faire de fausses alertes : les analystes vérifient chaque alerte avant d'agir.",
  "Porogaramu yiga uko imikorere isanzwe y'umukoresha na buri gikoresho imeze igatanga impuruza iyo hari ikidasanzwe, nko kwinjira uturutse mu gihugu gishya saa cyenda z'ijoro.",
  "Ifasha gufata konti zibwe n'abakozi b'inyuma y'ikigo amategeko yonyine atabona. Ishobora gutanga impuruza z'ibinyoma, ni yo mpamvu abasesenguzi bagenzura buri mpuruza.",
  "Programu inayojifunza shughuli za kawaida za kila mtumiaji na kifaa na kutoa tahadhari jambo lisilo la kawaida linapotokea, kama kuingia kutoka nchi mpya saa 9 usiku.",
  "Husaidia kunasa akaunti zilizoibwa na watu wa ndani ambao kanuni peke yake hukosa. Inaweza kutoa tahadhari za uongo, hivyo wachambuzi hukagua kila tahadhari kabla ya kutenda."),
 ("forensic-image", "Forensic image", ["forensic image", "disk image", "forensic copy", "bit-for-bit copy", "write blocker", "image forensique", "kopi y'ibimenyetso bya digitale", "nakala ya kiuchunguzi"], "operations", "hard drive forensic copy",
  {"fr": "Image forensique", "sw": "Nakala ya kiuchunguzi", "rw": "Kopi y'iperereza rya digitale"},
  "An exact bit-for-bit copy of a disk or phone made so that investigators can examine the copy and leave the original untouched.",
  "A write blocker prevents any change to the original, and a hash proves the copy matches. This keeps the evidence reliable in a disciplinary or court process.",
  "Copie exacte, bit à bit, d'un disque ou téléphone, réalisée pour que les enquêteurs examinent la copie sans toucher à l'original.",
  "Un bloqueur d'écriture empêche toute modification de l'original et un hachage prouve que la copie est identique. Les preuves restent ainsi fiables lors d'une procédure disciplinaire ou judiciaire.",
  "Kopi nyayo, bit kuri bit, ya disiki cyangwa telefone ikorwa kugira ngo abashinzwe iperereza basuzume kopi ntibakore ku cyambere.",
  "Write blocker ibuza guhindura icyambere naho hash igaragaza ko kopi ihwanye na cyo. Ibi bituma ibimenyetso bikomeza kwizerwa mu manza.",
  "Nakala kamili, bit kwa bit, ya diski au simu inayotengenezwa ili wachunguzi wakague nakala bila kugusa asili.",
  "Write blocker huzuia mabadiliko yoyote kwa asili na hash huthibitisha nakala inalingana. Hii huweka ushahidi wa kuaminika katika taratibu za nidhamu au mahakama."),
 ("file-integrity-monitoring", "File integrity monitoring (FIM)", ["file integrity monitoring", "fim", "tripwire", "file change detection", "surveillance d'intégrité des fichiers", "kugenzura impinduka za dosiye", "ufuatiliaji wa uadilifu wa faili"], "operations", "file change alert monitor",
  {"fr": "Surveillance de l'intégrité des fichiers", "sw": "Ufuatiliaji wa uadilifu wa faili", "rw": "Kugenzura ko dosiye zitahindutse (FIM)"},
  "A control that records a fingerprint (hash) of important files and alerts when one changes unexpectedly, for example a system file or a website page.",
  "Helps detect tampering such as a hacked web page or malware replacing a program. Changes made during planned updates are expected and approved.",
  "Contrôle qui enregistre l'empreinte (hachage) des fichiers importants et alerte quand l'un change de façon inattendue, par exemple un fichier système ou une page de site.",
  "Aide à détecter les altérations comme une page de site piratée ou un malware remplaçant un programme. Les changements des mises à jour planifiées sont attendus et validés.",
  "Ni uburyo bwandika igikumwe (hash) cya dosiye z'ingenzi bugatanga impuruza iyo imwe ihindutse bitunguranye, urugero dosiye ya sisitemu cyangwa urupapuro rw'urubuga.",
  "Bufasha gutahura guhindurwa nk'urupapuro rw'urubuga rwanyazwe cyangwa malware isimbuye porogaramu. Impinduka z'ivugurura ryateganyijwe ziba zitezwe kandi zemewe.",
  "Udhibiti unaorekodi alama (hash) ya faili muhimu na kutoa tahadhari moja inapobadilika bila kutarajiwa, mfano faili ya mfumo au ukurasa wa tovuti.",
  "Husaidia kugundua uchezeaji kama ukurasa wa tovuti uliodukuliwa au programu hasidi ikibadilisha programu. Mabadiliko ya masasisho yaliyopangwa yanatarajiwa na kuidhinishwa."),
 ("human-firewall", "Human firewall", ["human firewall", "pare-feu humain", "pare feu humain", "security culture", "security awareness culture", "umuntu nk'inkingi y'umutekano", "ngao ya binadamu"], "people", "employees training awareness",
  {"fr": "Pare-feu humain", "sw": "Ngao ya binadamu", "rw": "Umuntu nk'inkingi y'umutekano"},
  "The idea that trained, alert people are a layer of defence: staff who notice and report suspicious messages, calls and visitors stop many attacks before any tool does.",
  "Built with regular awareness training, simple reporting buttons and a blame-free culture. Most breaches start with a person being tricked, so people are part of the security system.",
  "L'idée que des personnes formées et attentives sont une couche de défense : le personnel qui repère et signale messages, appels et visiteurs suspects arrête beaucoup d'attaques avant tout outil.",
  "Construit par des formations régulières, des boutons de signalement simples et une culture sans reproche. La plupart des intrusions commencent par une personne trompée : les gens font partie du système de sécurité.",
  "Igitekerezo ko abantu bahuguwe kandi bashishoza ari urwego rw'uburinzi: abakozi babona bakamenyesha ubutumwa, guhamagara n'abashyitsi bakemangwa bahagarika ibitero byinshi mbere y'igikoresho icyo ari cyo cyose.",
  "Kibakwa n'amahugurwa asanzwe, buto yoroshye yo gutanga raporo n'umuco udashinja. Ibitero byinshi bitangira umuntu yavugishijwe nabi: abantu ni bamwe mu bigize umutekano.",
  "Wazo kwamba watu waliofunzwa na makini ni safu ya ulinzi: wafanyakazi wanaogundua na kuripoti ujumbe, simu na wageni wa kutiliwa shaka husimamisha mashambulizi mengi kabla ya zana yoyote.",
  "Hujengwa kwa mafunzo ya mara kwa mara, vitufe rahisi vya kuripoti na utamaduni usiolaumu. Uvunjaji mwingi huanza kwa mtu kudanganywa: watu ni sehemu ya mfumo wa usalama."),
 ("moving-target-defense", "Moving target defence", ["moving target defense", "moving target defence", "mtd defence", "changing configurations", "défense par cible mouvante", "defense dynamique"], "defense", "shifting network diagram",
  {"fr": "Défense par cible mouvante", "sw": "Ulinzi wa lengo linalosogea", "rw": "Uburinzi bwo guhindura intego"},
  "A defence idea that keeps changing parts of a system (addresses, ports, keys, software versions) so an attacker's knowledge goes out of date quickly.",
  "Examples include rotating keys and passwords, short-lived access tokens and re-building servers from clean images. It raises the cost of attacking but does not replace patching and monitoring.",
  "Idée de défense qui change en permanence des éléments d'un système (adresses, ports, clés, versions logicielles) pour que les connaissances de l'attaquant deviennent vite obsolètes.",
  "Exemples : rotation des clés et mots de passe, jetons d'accès de courte durée, reconstruction des serveurs depuis des images saines. Elle augmente le coût de l'attaque mais ne remplace ni correctifs ni surveillance.",
  "Ni igitekerezo cy'uburinzi gihora gihindura ibice bya sisitemu (aderesi, ports, imfunguzo, ubwoko bwa porogaramu) ku buryo ibyo umushimusi azi bishaje vuba.",
  "Ingero: guhindura imfunguzo n'amagambo y'ibanga, tokens z'igihe gito no kongera kubaka seriveri uhereye ku mashusho y'umutekano. Byongera igiciro cyo gutera ariko ntibisimbura patches no gukurikirana.",
  "Wazo la ulinzi linalobadilisha mara kwa mara sehemu za mfumo (anwani, port, funguo, matoleo ya programu) ili maarifa ya mshambulizi yapitwe na wakati haraka.",
  "Mifano ni kubadilisha funguo na nywila, tokeni za muda mfupi na kujenga upya seva kutoka picha safi. Huongeza gharama ya kushambulia lakini haichukui nafasi ya masasisho na ufuatiliaji."),
 ("chaos-engineering", "Chaos engineering", ["chaos engineering", "chaos monkey", "resilience testing", "failure injection", "ingénierie du chaos", "ingenierie du chaos", "gupima ubudahangarwa", "uhandisi wa machafuko"], "operations", "server failure test resilience",
  {"fr": "Ingénierie du chaos", "sw": "Uhandisi wa machafuko", "rw": "Chaos engineering"},
  "Deliberately breaking parts of a system in a controlled way (turning off a server, cutting a connection) to learn whether it keeps working and whether the team reacts well.",
  "Used by large online services to find weak points before a real outage or attack does. It is planned, limited in scope and done with a way to stop immediately.",
  "Casser volontairement et de façon contrôlée des parties d'un système (éteindre un serveur, couper une connexion) pour savoir s'il continue de fonctionner et si l'équipe réagit bien.",
  "Utilisée par les grands services en ligne pour trouver les points faibles avant une vraie panne ou attaque. Elle est planifiée, limitée et accompagnée d'un moyen d'arrêt immédiat.",
  "Ni ugusenya ku bushake mu buryo bugenzurwa ibice bya sisitemu (kuzimya seriveri, guca isano) kugira ngo umenye niba ikomeza gukora n'uko itsinda risubiza.",
  "Ikoreshwa na serivisi nini zo kuri interineti mu gushaka intege nke mbere y'uko ikibazo nyacyo cyangwa igitero kiza. Iba yateguwe, ifite aho igarukira kandi ifite uburyo bwo guhagarika ako kanya.",
  "Kuvunja kwa makusudi na kwa udhibiti sehemu za mfumo (kuzima seva, kukata muunganisho) ili kujua kama unaendelea kufanya kazi na kama timu inajibu vizuri.",
  "Hutumiwa na huduma kubwa za mtandaoni kupata sehemu dhaifu kabla ya hitilafu au shambulio halisi. Hupangwa, huwa na mipaka na njia ya kusimamisha mara moja."),
 ("post-exploitation", "Post-exploitation", ["post-exploitation", "post exploitation", "after the breach", "what attackers do after getting in", "post-exploitation phase", "après l'exploitation", "ibikurikira kwinjira", "baada ya kuingia"], "attacks", "attack lifecycle stages",
  {"fr": "Post-exploitation", "sw": "Hatua baada ya kuingia", "rw": "Ibikorwa nyuma yo kwinjira"},
  "What an attacker does after getting a first foothold: looking around, stealing more passwords, moving to other machines, staying hidden and finally taking data or locking files.",
  "Defenders detect this phase through unusual logins, new admin accounts, odd network traffic and tools running at strange times, which is why monitoring matters even after strong perimeter defences.",
  "Ce que fait un attaquant après un premier accès : explorer, voler d'autres mots de passe, passer à d'autres machines, rester caché puis prendre des données ou verrouiller des fichiers.",
  "Les défenseurs détectent cette phase via des connexions inhabituelles, de nouveaux comptes administrateur, un trafic réseau étrange et des outils lancés à des heures bizarres ; la surveillance compte donc même avec un bon périmètre.",
  "Ibyo umushimusi akora amaze kwinjira bwa mbere: kureba hirya no hino, kwiba andi magambo y'ibanga, kwimukira ku zindi mashini, kwihisha, hanyuma kwiba amakuru cyangwa gufunga dosiye.",
  "Abarinzi bayitahura binyuze mu kwinjira kudasanzwe, konti nshya za admin, urujya n'uruza rudasanzwe mu muyoboro n'ibikoresho bikora mu masaha adasanzwe; gukurikirana rero ni ingenzi nubwo uburinzi bw'inyuma bukomeye.",
  "Anachofanya mshambulizi baada ya kupata mlango wa kwanza: kuchunguza, kuiba nywila zaidi, kuhamia kompyuta nyingine, kubaki amejificha kisha kuchukua data au kufunga faili.",
  "Walinzi huigundua kupitia kuingia kusiko kawaida, akaunti mpya za admin, trafiki ya mtandao ya ajabu na zana zinazoendeshwa saa za ajabu; ufuatiliaji ni muhimu hata ulinzi wa nje ukiwa imara."),
 ("ram-scraping", "RAM scraping (memory scraping)", ["ram scraping", "memory scraping", "ram scraper", "pos malware", "point of sale malware", "extraction de mémoire", "gukuraho amakuru mu kwibuka", "kuvuna kumbukumbu ya RAM"], "attacks", "point of sale terminal memory",
  {"fr": "Extraction de mémoire (RAM scraping)", "sw": "Kuvuna kumbukumbu ya RAM", "rw": "Gukuraho amakuru mu kwibuka kwa mudasobwa (RAM scraping)"},
  "Malware that reads a computer's working memory to grab data that is briefly unencrypted there, such as card numbers on a payment terminal.",
  "Seen in attacks on shops and card payment systems. Protection includes encrypting card data from the terminal onward, updating payment systems and watching for unknown processes.",
  "Logiciel malveillant qui lit la mémoire vive d'un ordinateur pour saisir des données brièvement non chiffrées, comme des numéros de carte sur un terminal de paiement.",
  "Observé dans des attaques contre des commerces et systèmes de paiement par carte. Protection : chiffrer les données de carte dès le terminal, mettre à jour les systèmes de paiement et surveiller les processus inconnus.",
  "Malware isoma kwibuka gukora kwa mudasobwa ikavanamo amakuru adafunze mu gihe gito, nk'imibare ya karita kuri terminal yo kwishyuriraho.",
  "Yabonetse mu bitero ku maduka na sisitemu zo kwishyura ukoresheje karita. Kwirinda: gufunga amakuru ya karita uhereye kuri terminal, kuvugurura sisitemu zo kwishyura no gukurikirana porogaramu zitazwi.",
  "Programu hasidi inayosoma kumbukumbu ya kufanyia kazi ya kompyuta kunasa data ambayo haijasimbwa kwa muda mfupi, kama namba za kadi kwenye kifaa cha malipo.",
  "Imeonekana katika mashambulizi dhidi ya maduka na mifumo ya malipo ya kadi. Ulinzi: kusimba data ya kadi kuanzia kifaa, kusasisha mifumo ya malipo na kufuatilia michakato isiyojulikana."),
 ("screen-scraping", "Screen scraping and credential-sharing risk", ["screen scraping", "screen scraper", "bank login sharing", "sharing my bank password with an app", "grattage d'écran", "gutanga ijambo ry'ibanga rya banki kuri porogaramu", "kushiriki nywila ya benki na programu"], "privacy", "app bank login permissions",
  {"fr": "Aspiration d'écran / partage d'identifiants", "sw": "Kuvuna skrini / kushiriki nywila", "rw": "Gukuraho amakuru ku ecran / gusangiza ijambo ry'ibanga"},
  "A method where a program logs in as you, with your username and password, and copies what it sees on screen. Some finance apps once worked this way.",
  "Giving your bank password to a third-party app is risky: it can see everything and a leak exposes your account. Prefer official sign-in permissions that share only limited data and can be revoked.",
  "Méthode où un programme se connecte à votre place, avec votre identifiant et mot de passe, et copie ce qu'il voit à l'écran. Certaines applications financières fonctionnaient ainsi.",
  "Donner son mot de passe bancaire à une application tierce est risqué : elle voit tout et une fuite expose votre compte. Préférez les autorisations officielles qui ne partagent que des données limitées et sont révocables.",
  "Uburyo porogaramu yinjira nk'uko wowe ukoresheje izina ryawe n'ijambo ry'ibanga, igakopera ibyo ibona kuri ecran. Zimwe muri porogaramu z'imari zakoraga gutya.",
  "Gutanga ijambo ry'ibanga rya banki kuri porogaramu y'undi ni ibyago: ibona byose kandi kumeneka byatuma konti yawe ijya mu kaga. Hitamo uburenganzira bwemewe butanga amakuru make kandi bushobora guhagarikwa.",
  "Mbinu ambapo programu huingia kama wewe kwa jina na nywila yako na kunakili inachoona kwenye skrini. Baadhi ya programu za fedha zilifanya hivi.",
  "Kumpa programu ya mtu wa tatu nywila ya benki ni hatari: inaona kila kitu na uvujaji unaweka akaunti yako hatarini. Pendelea ruhusa rasmi zinazoshiriki data chache na zinazoweza kufutwa."),
 ("war-driving", "War driving", ["war driving", "wardriving", "wifi mapping", "wi-fi scanning from a car", "recherche de wifi en voiture", "gushakisha wifi uri mu modoka", "kutafuta wifi ukiwa kwenye gari"], "attacks", "wifi router antenna signal",
  {"fr": "War driving", "sw": "War driving", "rw": "War driving"},
  "Driving or walking around with a laptop or phone to find and map wireless networks, especially weakly protected ones.",
  "Weak Wi-Fi (no password, old WEP) can be joined or spied on from the street. Use WPA2 or WPA3 with a long passphrase, change the router's default admin password and keep its firmware updated.",
  "Se déplacer en voiture ou à pied avec un ordinateur ou téléphone pour repérer et cartographier des réseaux sans fil, surtout les mal protégés.",
  "Un Wi-Fi faible (sans mot de passe, ancien WEP) peut être rejoint ou espionné depuis la rue. Utilisez WPA2 ou WPA3 avec une longue phrase secrète, changez le mot de passe administrateur du routeur et mettez à jour son firmware.",
  "Kugenda mu modoka cyangwa n'amaguru ufite mudasobwa cyangwa telefone ushaka no gushushanya imiyoboro ya wireless, cyane cyane idakingiye neza.",
  "Wi-Fi ifite intege nke (nta jambo ry'ibanga, WEP ya kera) ishobora kwinjirwamo cyangwa gusuzumwa uri ku muhanda. Koresha WPA2 cyangwa WPA3 n'interuro y'ibanga ndende, uhindure ijambo ry'ibanga rya admin rya router kandi uvugurure firmware yayo.",
  "Kuendesha au kutembea na kompyuta au simu kutafuta na kuchora ramani ya mitandao ya wireless, hasa iliyolindwa vibaya.",
  "Wi-Fi dhaifu (bila nywila, WEP ya zamani) inaweza kuunganishwa au kupelelezwa ukiwa barabarani. Tumia WPA2 au WPA3 yenye nenosiri refu, badilisha nywila ya admin ya router na usasishe firmware yake."),
 ("time-bomb", "Time bomb (malware)", ["time bomb", "time bomb malware", "delayed malware", "sleeper malware", "bombe à retardement", "bombe a retardement", "malware ibanza gutegereza", "programu hasidi ya muda"], "malware", "countdown clock code",
  {"fr": "Bombe à retardement", "sw": "Bomu la muda (programu hasidi)", "rw": "Malware itegereza igihe"},
  "Harmful code that stays hidden and does nothing until a set date or time, then activates. A logic bomb waits for a condition instead, such as an employee's account being deleted.",
  "Often planted by an angry insider or hidden in pirated software. Code reviews, restricted admin rights and monitoring of scheduled tasks help catch it.",
  "Code malveillant qui reste caché sans rien faire jusqu'à une date ou heure fixée, puis s'active. Une bombe logique attend plutôt une condition, comme la suppression du compte d'un employé.",
  "Souvent posée par un initié en colère ou cachée dans des logiciels piratés. Revues de code, droits d'administrateur limités et surveillance des tâches planifiées aident à la détecter.",
  "Code mbi yihishe ntagire icyo ikora kugeza ku matariki cyangwa isaha runaka, hanyuma ikaza gukora. Logic bomb yo itegereza ikintu runaka, nko gusibwa kwa konti y'umukozi.",
  "Akenshi ishyirwamo n'umukozi w'imbere urakaye cyangwa yihishe muri porogaramu z'ibisambo. Gusuzuma code, kugabanya uburenganzira bwa admin no gukurikirana imirimo iteganyijwe birafasha kuyifata.",
  "Msimbo hasidi unaojificha bila kufanya kitu hadi tarehe au saa fulani, kisha huwaka. Logic bomb hungoja sharti badala yake, kama akaunti ya mfanyakazi kufutwa.",
  "Mara nyingi hupandwa na mtu wa ndani mwenye hasira au kufichwa kwenye programu zilizopakuliwa bila leseni. Ukaguzi wa msimbo, haki chache za admin na ufuatiliaji wa kazi zilizopangwa husaidia kuikamata."),
 ("traffic-analysis", "Traffic analysis", ["traffic analysis", "metadata analysis", "network metadata", "analyse du trafic", "analyse de trafic", "isesengura ry'urujya n'uruza rw'amakuru", "uchambuzi wa trafiki"], "attacks", "network traffic graph",
  {"fr": "Analyse du trafic", "sw": "Uchambuzi wa trafiki", "rw": "Isesengura ry'urujya n'uruza"},
  "Studying who talks to whom, when and how much, even when the content is encrypted. Metadata alone can reveal habits and relationships.",
  "It is also a defensive tool: defenders use traffic analysis to spot a hacked device sending data to an unusual server. For privacy, tools such as Tor and VPNs reduce what observers learn.",
  "Étudier qui parle à qui, quand et en quelle quantité, même quand le contenu est chiffré. Les métadonnées seules peuvent révéler habitudes et relations.",
  "C'est aussi un outil défensif : les défenseurs repèrent ainsi un appareil piraté qui envoie des données vers un serveur inhabituel. Pour la vie privée, Tor et les VPN réduisent ce que les observateurs apprennent.",
  "Gusuzuma uvugana na nde, ryari kandi angana iki, nubwo ibiri mu butumwa bifunze. Metadata yonyine ishobora kugaragaza imigenzo n'isano.",
  "Ni n'igikoresho cyo kwirinda: abarinzi bakoresha isesengura rirebera igikoresho cyanyazwe cyohereza amakuru kuri seriveri idasanzwe. Ku bwigenge, Tor na VPN bigabanya ibyo indorerezi zimenya.",
  "Kusoma nani anazungumza na nani, lini na kiasi gani, hata maudhui yakiwa yamesimbwa. Metadata pekee inaweza kufichua tabia na mahusiano.",
  "Pia ni zana ya ulinzi: walinzi hutumia uchambuzi wa trafiki kugundua kifaa kilichodukuliwa kikituma data kwa seva isiyo ya kawaida. Kwa faragha, Tor na VPN hupunguza wanachojua waangalizi."),
 ("thread-hijacking", "Email thread hijacking", ["thread hijacking", "conversation hijacking", "email thread hijacking", "reply chain attack", "reply-chain phishing", "détournement de conversation", "kwinjira mu mubano w'imeri", "udukuzi wa mazungumzo ya barua pepe"], "social", "email conversation thread",
  {"fr": "Détournement de fil de discussion", "sw": "Udukuzi wa mazungumzo ya barua pepe", "rw": "Kwinjira mu mubano w'imeri"},
  "An attacker with access to a hacked mailbox replies inside a real, ongoing email conversation with a malicious link or changed payment details, so the message looks completely natural.",
  "Because it comes from a real contact in a real thread, it bypasses suspicion. Before acting on payment changes or unexpected attachments, confirm by phone with a number you already know.",
  "Un attaquant qui contrôle une boîte piratée répond dans une vraie conversation en cours avec un lien malveillant ou de nouvelles coordonnées de paiement, si bien que le message paraît tout à fait naturel.",
  "Venant d'un vrai contact dans un vrai fil, il échappe aux soupçons. Avant d'agir sur un changement de paiement ou une pièce jointe inattendue, confirmez par téléphone via un numéro déjà connu.",
  "Umushimusi ufite uburenganzira kuri imeri yanyazwe asubiza mu mubano nyakuri w'imeri akoresheje link mbi cyangwa amakuru mashya yo kwishyura, bityo ubutumwa bugasa neza rwose.",
  "Kubera ko buturuka ku muntu nyakuri mu mubano nyakuri, ntibutera amakenga. Mbere yo gukora ku mpinduka y'ubwishyu cyangwa attachment itunguranye, emeza kuri telefone ukoresheje nimero usanzwe uzi.",
  "Mshambulizi mwenye ufikiaji wa sanduku la barua lililodukuliwa hujibu ndani ya mazungumzo halisi yanayoendelea kwa kiungo hasidi au maelezo mapya ya malipo, ujumbe ukionekana wa kawaida kabisa.",
  "Kwa kuwa unatoka kwa mtu halisi kwenye mazungumzo halisi, huepuka shaka. Kabla ya kutenda kwa mabadiliko ya malipo au kiambatisho kisichotarajiwa, thibitisha kwa simu kwa namba unayoijua."),
 ("unpatched-vulnerability", "Unpatched vulnerability", ["unpatched vulnerability", "unpatched software", "missing patch", "outdated software", "known vulnerability", "vulnérabilité non corrigée", "vulnerabilite non corrigee", "logiciel obsolète", "intege nke zitarakosorwa", "udhaifu usiorekebishwa"], "attacks", "outdated software update warning",
  {"fr": "Vulnérabilité non corrigée", "sw": "Udhaifu ambao haujarekebishwa", "rw": "Intege nke itarakosorwa"},
  "A known weakness in software for which a fix exists but has not been installed yet. Most successful attacks use old, known flaws rather than brand-new ones.",
  "Installing updates quickly (patch management), turning on automatic updates and retiring software that no longer gets updates are among the cheapest and most effective protections.",
  "Faille connue d'un logiciel dont le correctif existe mais n'a pas encore été installé. La plupart des attaques réussies exploitent de vieilles failles connues plutôt que des failles toutes neuves.",
  "Installer vite les mises à jour (gestion des correctifs), activer les mises à jour automatiques et retirer les logiciels qui ne sont plus mis à jour figurent parmi les protections les moins chères et les plus efficaces.",
  "Intege nke izwi muri porogaramu ifite igisubizo (patch) kitarashyirwaho. Ibitero byinshi bigera ku ntego bikoresha intege nke za kera zizwi, si nshya.",
  "Gushyiraho ivugurura vuba (patch management), gufungura ivugurura ryikora no kureka porogaramu zitagifite ivugurura ni zimwe mu ngamba zihendutse kandi zikora neza.",
  "Udhaifu unaojulikana kwenye programu ambao marekebisho yake yapo lakini bado hayajasakinishwa. Mashambulizi mengi yanayofanikiwa hutumia mapungufu ya zamani yanayojulikana, si mapya.",
  "Kusakinisha masasisho haraka (patch management), kuwasha masasisho ya kiotomatiki na kuacha programu zisizopata masasisho ni kati ya ulinzi wa gharama nafuu na wenye ufanisi zaidi."),
 ("diceware-passphrase", "Passphrase (Diceware method)", ["diceware", "passphrase", "passphrases", "long passphrase", "random words password", "correct horse battery staple", "phrase secrète", "phrase de passe", "interuro y'ibanga", "nenosiri la maneno"], "defense", "random words password",
  {"fr": "Phrase secrète (méthode Diceware)", "sw": "Nenosiri la maneno (Diceware)", "rw": "Interuro y'ibanga (Diceware)"},
  "A password made of four to six random words, for example from dice rolls and a word list. It is long and easy to remember but very hard for computers to guess.",
  "Use a passphrase for your password manager and your email, and a unique password for each other account. Randomness matters: a famous quote or lyric is much weaker than random words.",
  "Mot de passe composé de quatre à six mots aléatoires, par exemple tirés avec des dés et une liste de mots. Il est long, facile à retenir et très difficile à deviner pour un ordinateur.",
  "Utilisez-en une pour votre gestionnaire de mots de passe et votre e-mail, et un mot de passe unique pour chaque autre compte. Le hasard compte : une citation célèbre ou des paroles de chanson sont bien plus faibles que des mots aléatoires.",
  "Ijambo ry'ibanga rigizwe n'amagambo ane kugeza kuri atandatu y'amahirwe, urugero ahawe n'udupfunyika tw'amakamba n'urutonde rw'amagambo. Ni rirerire, ryoroshye kwibuka kandi mudasobwa igorwa no kuryiketsa.",
  "Rikoreshe ku bubiko bw'amagambo y'ibanga no kuri imeri yawe, naho kuri buri yindi konti ugire irihariye. Amahirwe ni ngombwa: amagambo y'umuhanzi cyangwa imvugo izwi ni intege nke kurusha amagambo y'amahirwe.",
  "Nenosiri la maneno manne hadi sita ya nasibu, mfano kutoka kwa kete na orodha ya maneno. Ni refu, rahisi kukumbuka na gumu sana kwa kompyuta kukisia.",
  "Litumie kwa kidhibiti cha nywila na barua pepe yako, na nywila ya kipekee kwa kila akaunti nyingine. Nasibu ni muhimu: nukuu maarufu au maneno ya wimbo ni dhaifu zaidi kuliko maneno ya nasibu."),
 ("online-harassment", "Online harassment", ["online harassment", "cyber harassment", "cyberstalking", "online abuse", "trolling", "harcèlement en ligne", "harcelement en ligne", "gutoteza kuri interineti", "unyanyasaji mtandaoni"], "privacy", "person phone harassment messages",
  {"fr": "Harcèlement en ligne", "sw": "Unyanyasaji mtandaoni", "rw": "Gutoteza no guhohotera kuri interineti"},
  "Repeated unwanted, threatening or humiliating contact online, such as abusive messages, spreading rumours, sharing private photos without consent, or following someone across accounts.",
  "Do not reply, keep screenshots with dates, block and report the account on the platform, tighten privacy settings and tell a trusted adult or friend. Serious threats or image-based abuse can be reported to the police.",
  "Contacts répétés, non désirés, menaçants ou humiliants en ligne : messages injurieux, rumeurs, partage de photos privées sans consentement ou suivi d'une personne sur plusieurs comptes.",
  "Ne répondez pas, gardez des captures d'écran datées, bloquez et signalez le compte sur la plateforme, renforcez vos paramètres de confidentialité et prévenez une personne de confiance. Les menaces graves ou le partage d'images sans consentement peuvent être signalés à la police.",
  "Kuvugana kenshi kutakenewe, gutera ubwoba cyangwa gusuzugura kuri interineti, nko kohereza ubutumwa bw'ibitutsi, gukwirakwiza ibihuha, gusangiza amafoto bwite nta ruhushya cyangwa gukurikirana umuntu kuri konti nyinshi.",
  "Ntusubize, bika screenshots zifite amatariki, hagarika kandi utange raporo ya konti ku rubuga, ukomeze igenamiterere ry'ibanga kandi ubibwire umuntu wizeye. Iterabwoba rikomeye cyangwa gusangiza amashusho nta ruhushya bishobora gutangirwa ikirego kuri polisi.",
  "Mawasiliano ya mara kwa mara yasiyotakiwa, ya vitisho au ya kudhalilisha mtandaoni, kama jumbe za matusi, kueneza uvumi, kushiriki picha za faragha bila ridhaa au kumfuatilia mtu kwenye akaunti nyingi.",
  "Usijibu, hifadhi picha za skrini zenye tarehe, mzuie na uripoti akaunti kwenye jukwaa, imarisha mipangilio ya faragha na umwambie mtu unayemwamini. Vitisho vikubwa au kushiriki picha bila ridhaa vinaweza kuripotiwa polisi."),
 ("trusted-contact-recovery", "Trusted contact and account recovery setup", ["trusted contact", "recovery contact", "account recovery", "recovery email", "recovery codes", "backup codes", "social recovery", "account recovery abuse", "contact de confiance", "récupération de compte", "recuperation de compte", "kugarura konti", "kurejesha akaunti"], "identity", "account recovery email phone",
  {"fr": "Contact de confiance et récupération de compte", "sw": "Mawasiliano ya kuaminika na kurejesha akaunti", "rw": "Umuntu wizewe no kugarura konti"},
  "Recovery options (a second email, phone number, backup codes or a trusted contact) that let you get back into an account if you lose your password. Attackers also abuse them to take accounts over.",
  "Set recovery details now, keep backup codes offline, and keep the recovery email as well protected as the account itself. Never share a recovery code: a message asking for it is a takeover attempt.",
  "Options de récupération (second e-mail, numéro de téléphone, codes de secours ou contact de confiance) qui permettent de récupérer un compte si vous perdez votre mot de passe. Les attaquants les détournent aussi pour prendre des comptes.",
  "Configurez-les dès maintenant, gardez les codes de secours hors ligne et protégez l'e-mail de récupération autant que le compte. Ne partagez jamais un code de récupération : un message qui le demande est une tentative de prise de contrôle.",
  "Uburyo bwo kugarura konti (imeri ya kabiri, nimero ya telefone, kode z'ubwirinzi cyangwa umuntu wizewe) bukwemerera kongera kwinjira niba wibagiwe ijambo ry'ibanga. Abagizi ba nabi na bo barabukoresha mu kwiba konti.",
  "Bishyireho none, bika kode z'ubwirinzi hanze ya interineti kandi urinde imeri yo kugarura nk'uko urinda konti. Ntuzigere usangiza kode yo kugarura: ubutumwa bubisaba ni igerageza ryo kwiba konti.",
  "Chaguo za kurejesha (barua pepe ya pili, namba ya simu, misimbo ya akiba au mtu anayeaminika) zinazokuwezesha kurudi kwenye akaunti ukipoteza nywila. Wahalifu pia huzitumia vibaya kuchukua akaunti.",
  "Ziweke sasa, hifadhi misimbo ya akiba nje ya mtandao na ulinde barua pepe ya kurejesha kama akaunti yenyewe. Kamwe usishiriki msimbo wa kurejesha: ujumbe unaouomba ni jaribio la kuchukua akaunti."),
 ("credit-freeze", "Credit freeze and fraud alerts", ["credit freeze", "security freeze", "fraud alert", "credit report lock", "blocage de crédit", "gufunga amakuru y'inguzanyo", "kufunga ripoti ya mkopo"], "privacy", "credit report lock shield",
  {"fr": "Gel de crédit et alertes fraude", "sw": "Kufunga ripoti ya mkopo", "rw": "Gufunga amakuru y'inguzanyo"},
  "A tool in some countries that blocks new loans or credit accounts from being opened in your name until you unlock it, so a thief who has your personal details cannot borrow as you.",
  "Mainly used where credit bureaus exist (for example the United States). In Rwanda and elsewhere, check your credit status with your bank, report stolen ID details quickly and never share your national ID number casually.",
  "Outil existant dans certains pays qui empêche l'ouverture de nouveaux prêts ou comptes de crédit à votre nom tant que vous ne le levez pas ; un voleur disposant de vos données ne peut donc pas emprunter à votre place.",
  "Surtout utilisé là où existent des bureaux de crédit (par exemple aux États-Unis). Au Rwanda et ailleurs, vérifiez votre situation auprès de votre banque, signalez vite le vol d'informations d'identité et ne communiquez pas à la légère votre numéro de carte d'identité.",
  "Ni uburyo mu bihugu bimwe bubuza gufungurwa kw'inguzanyo cyangwa konti nshya mu izina ryawe kugeza ubufunguye, bityo umujura ufite amakuru yawe ntashobora kuguza nk'uwo uri we.",
  "Bukoreshwa cyane aho hari ibigo bikurikirana inguzanyo (urugero Amerika). Mu Rwanda n'ahandi, genzura uko uhagaze kuri banki yawe, bimenyeshe vuba iyo amakuru y'indangamuntu yibwe kandi ntukavuge nimero y'indangamuntu uko wishakiye.",
  "Zana katika baadhi ya nchi inayozuia mikopo au akaunti mpya kufunguliwa kwa jina lako hadi uifungue, hivyo mwizi mwenye taarifa zako hawezi kukopa kama wewe.",
  "Hutumika zaidi pale zilipo ofisi za taarifa za mikopo (mfano Marekani). Rwanda na kwingineko, kagua hali yako kupitia benki yako, ripoti haraka taarifa za kitambulisho zilizoibwa na usishiriki kiholela namba ya kitambulisho."),
 ("identity-monitoring", "Identity and breach monitoring", ["identity monitoring", "breach monitoring", "have i been pwned", "haveibeenpwned", "pwned", "dark web monitoring", "email breach check", "surveillance d'identité", "gukurikirana niba amakuru yawe yameneka", "kufuatilia uvujaji wa taarifa"], "privacy", "email breach check alert",
  {"fr": "Surveillance d'identité et de fuites", "sw": "Ufuatiliaji wa uvujaji wa taarifa", "rw": "Gukurikirana kumeneka kw'amakuru yawe"},
  "Services that tell you if your email address or password appeared in a known data breach. Have I Been Pwned is a well-known free example.",
  "If you are listed, change that password everywhere it was used, turn on two-step login and watch for phishing that uses the leaked details. Always type the site's address yourself rather than following a link in an alert.",
  "Services qui vous disent si votre adresse e-mail ou mot de passe est apparu dans une fuite de données connue. Have I Been Pwned en est un exemple gratuit bien connu.",
  "Si vous y figurez, changez ce mot de passe partout où il servait, activez la connexion en deux étapes et méfiez-vous du phishing utilisant les données divulguées. Tapez toujours vous-même l'adresse du site au lieu de suivre un lien dans une alerte.",
  "Serivisi zikubwira niba imeri cyangwa ijambo ry'ibanga ryawe ryagaragaye mu kumeneka kw'amakuru kuzwi. Have I Been Pwned ni urugero ruzwi rw'ubuntu.",
  "Niba urimo, hindura iryo jambo ry'ibanga aho ryose wariakoresheje, fungura kwinjira mu byiciro bibiri kandi witondere phishing ikoresha amakuru yamenetse. Buri gihe andika wowe aderesi y'urubuga aho gukurikira link iri mu mpuruza.",
  "Huduma zinazokuambia kama barua pepe au nywila yako ilionekana kwenye uvujaji wa data unaojulikana. Have I Been Pwned ni mfano maarufu wa bure.",
  "Ukiwemo, badilisha nywila hiyo kila mahali ilipotumika, washa kuingia kwa hatua mbili na jihadhari na hadaa zinazotumia taarifa zilizovuja. Andika mwenyewe anwani ya tovuti badala ya kufuata kiungo kwenye tahadhari."),
 ("digital-legacy", "Digital legacy and account inheritance", ["digital legacy", "digital estate", "inactive account manager", "legacy contact", "account after death", "héritage numérique", "heritage numerique", "konti z'uwapfuye", "urithi wa kidijitali"], "privacy", "digital will account settings",
  {"fr": "Héritage numérique", "sw": "Urithi wa kidijitali", "rw": "Konti n'amakuru by'uwapfuye"},
  "What happens to someone's accounts, photos and money apps when they die or cannot act. Many platforms let you name a legacy contact or set an inactive-account rule.",
  "Keep a secure list of important accounts, tell a trusted person where recovery information is, and never share passwords in chat. Criminals also exploit grief, so be careful with strangers who claim a deceased person's money.",
  "Ce qui arrive aux comptes, photos et applications d'argent de quelqu'un après son décès ou son incapacité. Beaucoup de plateformes permettent de désigner un contact légataire ou de régler un compte inactif.",
  "Gardez une liste sécurisée des comptes importants, dites à une personne de confiance où se trouvent les informations de récupération et ne partagez jamais de mots de passe par messagerie. Les criminels exploitent aussi le deuil : méfiez-vous des inconnus qui réclament l'argent d'un défunt.",
  "Ibiba kuri konti, amafoto n'porogaramu z'amafaranga z'umuntu iyo yapfuye cyangwa adashoboye gukora. Imbuga nyinshi zemerera guhitamo umuntu uzakurikirana cyangwa gushyiraho amategeko ku konti zidakoreshwa.",
  "Bika urutonde rurinzwe rwa konti z'ingenzi, ubwire umuntu wizeye aho amakuru yo kugarura abitse kandi ntusangize amagambo y'ibanga mu butumwa. Abagizi ba nabi bakoresha n'agahinda: ugire amakenga ku batazwi bavuga ko bafite amafaranga y'uwapfuye.",
  "Kinachotokea kwa akaunti, picha na programu za pesa za mtu akifa au akishindwa kutenda. Majukwaa mengi hukuruhusu kuteua mwasiliani wa urithi au kuweka kanuni kwa akaunti zisizotumika.",
  "Weka orodha salama ya akaunti muhimu, mwambie mtu unayemwamini maelezo ya kurejesha yako wapi na usishiriki nywila kwenye mazungumzo. Wahalifu pia hutumia majonzi: kuwa makini na wageni wanaodai pesa za marehemu."),
 ("data-hygiene", "Data hygiene (cyber hygiene for your files and accounts)", ["data hygiene", "digital declutter", "delete old accounts", "clean up accounts", "minimise stored data", "hygiène des données", "hygiene des donnees", "isuku y'amakuru", "usafi wa data"], "practice", "cleaning old accounts files",
  {"fr": "Hygiène des données", "sw": "Usafi wa data", "rw": "Isuku y'amakuru"},
  "Regular tidying of your digital life: delete old accounts and apps, remove files you no longer need, review who has access to your folders and what apps may see on your phone.",
  "Less data stored means less to lose in a breach. Do it every few months: check app permissions, unsubscribe from unneeded services, empty downloads and review connected devices on your main accounts.",
  "Rangement régulier de votre vie numérique : supprimer anciens comptes et applications, retirer les fichiers inutiles, revoir qui accède à vos dossiers et ce que les applications voient sur votre téléphone.",
  "Moins de données stockées, moins à perdre lors d'une fuite. Faites-le tous les quelques mois : vérifiez les permissions des applications, désabonnez-vous des services inutiles, videz les téléchargements et revoyez les appareils connectés à vos comptes principaux.",
  "Gutunganya buri gihe ubuzima bwawe bwa digitale: gusiba konti na porogaramu za kera, gukuraho dosiye udakeneye, kureba ubona ububiko bwawe n'ibyo porogaramu zibona kuri telefone.",
  "Amakuru make abitswe, make yatakara mu kumeneka. Bikore buri mezi make: genzura uburenganzira bwa porogaramu, reka serivisi zidakenewe, siba ibyakuwe kandi urebe ibikoresho bihujwe na konti zawe nkuru.",
  "Kusafisha mara kwa mara maisha yako ya kidijitali: kufuta akaunti na programu za zamani, kuondoa faili usizohitaji, kukagua nani anafikia folda zako na programu zinaona nini kwenye simu.",
  "Data chache zilizohifadhiwa ni chache za kupoteza kwenye uvujaji. Fanya hivyo kila baada ya miezi michache: kagua ruhusa za programu, jiondoe kwenye huduma zisizohitajika, futa vilivyopakuliwa na kagua vifaa vilivyounganishwa kwenye akaunti kuu."),
 ("llm-jailbreak", "LLM jailbreak and AI chatbot manipulation", ["llm jailbreak", "jailbreak llm", "ai jailbreak", "chatbot jailbreak", "chatbot manipulation", "dan prompt", "jailbreaking an ai", "contournement d'ia", "kwinjira mu mbogamizi za AI", "kuvunja vikwazo vya AI"], "attacks", "chatbot safety guardrails",
  {"fr": "Jailbreak d'IA / manipulation de chatbot", "sw": "Kuvunja vikwazo vya AI", "rw": "Gukoresha AI mu buryo burenga amategeko yayo"},
  "Tricking an AI chatbot with clever wording, role-play or hidden instructions into ignoring its safety rules. It is related to prompt injection, where instructions hidden in a document or web page steer the AI.",
  "Builders defend with layered safety checks, limited tool permissions and human review of risky actions. Users should never paste secrets into a chatbot and should treat its answers as drafts that need checking.",
  "Tromper un chatbot d'IA par des formulations astucieuses, du jeu de rôle ou des instructions cachées pour qu'il ignore ses règles de sécurité. Proche de l'injection de prompt, où des instructions cachées dans un document ou une page web orientent l'IA.",
  "Les concepteurs défendent par des contrôles de sécurité en couches, des permissions d'outils limitées et une relecture humaine des actions risquées. Les utilisateurs ne doivent jamais coller de secrets dans un chatbot et doivent vérifier ses réponses.",
  "Kuriganya chatbot ya AI ukoresheje amagambo y'ubwenge, gukina uruhare cyangwa amabwiriza yihishe kugira ngo yirengagize amategeko yayo y'umutekano. Bifitanye isano na prompt injection, aho amabwiriza yihishe mu nyandiko cyangwa urupapuro rw'urubuga atuma AI ikora ibyo ititeguye.",
  "Abashyiraho AI bayirinda bakoresheje ibyiciro byinshi by'ubugenzuzi, kugabanya uburenganzira bw'ibikoresho no gusuzumwa n'abantu ku bikorwa bibi. Abakoresha ntibagomba guhamba amabanga muri chatbot kandi bagomba kugenzura ibisubizo byayo.",
  "Kudanganya chatbot ya AI kwa maneno ya ujanja, kuigiza majukumu au maagizo yaliyofichwa ili ipuuze kanuni zake za usalama. Inahusiana na prompt injection, ambapo maagizo yaliyofichwa kwenye hati au ukurasa wa wavuti huongoza AI.",
  "Wajenzi hulinda kwa ukaguzi wa tabaka, ruhusa chache za zana na ukaguzi wa binadamu kwa vitendo hatari. Watumiaji wasibandike siri kwenye chatbot na wachukulie majibu kama rasimu zinazohitaji kukaguliwa."),
 ("model-theft", "AI model theft and extraction", ["model theft", "model extraction", "model stealing", "ai model theft", "stealing ai models", "vol de modèle", "vol de modele", "kwiba moderi ya AI", "wizi wa modeli ya AI"], "attacks", "ai neural network lock",
  {"fr": "Vol de modèle d'IA", "sw": "Wizi wa modeli ya AI", "rw": "Kwiba moderi ya AI"},
  "Copying an AI model, or rebuilding a close copy of it by sending many queries and learning from the answers, so a competitor or criminal gets the value without paying for the work.",
  "Providers limit query rates, watch for unusual patterns, protect model files with access control and encryption and add legal terms. Related AI risks include data poisoning and adversarial inputs.",
  "Copier un modèle d'IA, ou en reconstituer une copie proche en envoyant beaucoup de requêtes et en apprenant des réponses, pour qu'un concurrent ou un criminel profite de sa valeur sans payer le travail.",
  "Les fournisseurs limitent le rythme des requêtes, surveillent les schémas inhabituels, protègent les fichiers du modèle par contrôle d'accès et chiffrement et ajoutent des conditions juridiques. Autres risques liés à l'IA : empoisonnement des données et entrées adverses.",
  "Gukopera moderi ya AI, cyangwa kongera kubaka kopi nyayo yayo wohereza ibibazo byinshi ukiga mu bisubizo, ku buryo uhanganye cyangwa umugizi wa nabi abona agaciro kayo atishyuye umurimo.",
  "Abatanga serivisi bagabanya umubare w'ibibazo, bakurikirana imiterere idasanzwe, barinda dosiye za moderi bakoresheje kugenzura uburenganzira na encryption kandi bashyiraho amategeko. Izindi ngaruka za AI: data poisoning n'ibyinjizwa byateguriwe kuyobya.",
  "Kunakili modeli ya AI, au kujenga nakala inayokaribia kwa kutuma maswali mengi na kujifunza kutoka majibu, ili mshindani au mhalifu apate thamani bila kulipia kazi.",
  "Watoa huduma hupunguza kasi ya maswali, hufuatilia mifumo isiyo ya kawaida, hulinda faili za modeli kwa udhibiti wa ufikiaji na usimbaji na huongeza masharti ya kisheria. Hatari nyingine za AI ni data poisoning na ingizo la kupotosha."),
 ("airdrop-scam", "Crypto airdrop and fake giveaway scam", ["airdrop scam", "crypto airdrop scam", "free crypto scam", "fake airdrop", "token giveaway scam", "arnaque airdrop", "uburiganya bwa airdrop", "ulaghai wa airdrop"], "social", "crypto giveaway wallet connect",
  {"fr": "Arnaque à l'airdrop crypto", "sw": "Ulaghai wa airdrop ya crypto", "rw": "Uburiganya bwa airdrop ya crypto"},
  "A promise of free tokens or coins if you connect your wallet, claim on a website or send a small amount first. The site actually drains your wallet or steals your seed phrase.",
  "Never enter your seed phrase anywhere, never connect your wallet to a site from an unsolicited message, and remember that real giveaways never need you to pay first. Use a separate small wallet for experiments.",
  "Promesse de jetons ou pièces gratuits si vous connectez votre portefeuille, les réclamez sur un site ou envoyez d'abord un petit montant. Le site vide en réalité votre portefeuille ou vole votre phrase de récupération.",
  "N'entrez jamais votre phrase de récupération nulle part, ne connectez jamais votre portefeuille à un site reçu par message non sollicité, et rappelez-vous qu'un vrai cadeau n'exige jamais de payer d'abord. Utilisez un petit portefeuille séparé pour tester.",
  "Isezerano ry'ama tokens cyangwa coins ku buntu niba uhuje wallet yawe, ubisaba ku rubuga cyangwa ubanza kohereza amafaranga make. Mu by'ukuri urubuga rwuzuza wallet yawe cyangwa rukiba seed phrase yawe.",
  "Ntuzigere winjiza seed phrase yawe ahantu na hamwe, ntuzigere uhuza wallet n'urubuga rwaje mu butumwa utasabye, kandi wibuke ko impano nyayo itigera igusaba kubanza kwishyura. Koresha wallet nto itandukanye mu kugerageza.",
  "Ahadi ya tokeni au sarafu za bure ukiunganisha pochi yako, kudai kwenye tovuti au kutuma kiasi kidogo kwanza. Kwa kweli tovuti humaliza pochi yako au kuiba seed phrase yako.",
  "Kamwe usiingize seed phrase mahali popote, kamwe usiunganishe pochi na tovuti iliyotoka kwa ujumbe usioombwa, na kumbuka zawadi halisi haitaki ulipe kwanza. Tumia pochi ndogo tofauti kwa majaribio."),
 ("nft-scam", "NFT and fake collectible scam", ["nft scam", "fake nft", "nft rug pull", "nft giveaway scam", "nft phishing", "arnaque nft", "uburiganya bwa nft", "ulaghai wa nft"], "social", "nft artwork marketplace warning",
  {"fr": "Arnaque aux NFT", "sw": "Ulaghai wa NFT", "rw": "Uburiganya bwa NFT"},
  "Fraud around digital collectibles: fake collections that copy real artists, fake marketplaces, hype to push a price and then abandoning the project, or messages offering a “free mint” that drains your wallet.",
  "Buy only through well-known marketplaces by typing their address yourself, check the creator's official channels, never sign a transaction you do not understand and never invest money you cannot afford to lose.",
  "Fraudes autour des objets de collection numériques : fausses collections copiant de vrais artistes, faux marchés, battage pour gonfler un prix puis abandon du projet, ou messages offrant un « mint gratuit » qui vide votre portefeuille.",
  "N'achetez que sur des places de marché connues en tapant vous-même leur adresse, vérifiez les canaux officiels du créateur, ne signez jamais une transaction que vous ne comprenez pas et n'investissez jamais ce que vous ne pouvez pas perdre.",
  "Uburiganya bukorerwa ku bintu bya digitale bikusanywa: ibyegeranyo by'impimbano bikopera abahanzi nyabo, amasoko y'impimbano, kuvuga cyane kugira ngo igiciro gizamuke hanyuma umushinga ugatabwa, cyangwa ubutumwa butanga «free mint» yuzuza wallet yawe.",
  "Gura gusa ku masoko azwi wandika wowe aderesi yayo, genzura imiyoboro yemewe y'uwabikoze, ntusinye igikorwa utumva kandi ntuzigere ushora amafaranga udashobora gutakaza.",
  "Ulaghai kuhusu vitu vya kidijitali vya kukusanya: mkusanyiko bandia unaonakili wasanii halisi, masoko bandia, kelele za kupandisha bei kisha mradi kuachwa, au jumbe zinazotoa «free mint» inayomaliza pochi yako.",
  "Nunua kupitia masoko yanayojulikana kwa kuandika mwenyewe anwani yake, kagua njia rasmi za muumbaji, kamwe usisaini muamala usioelewa na usiwekeze pesa usizoweza kupoteza."),
 ("approval-phishing", "Token approval phishing", ["approval phishing", "token approval scam", "unlimited approval", "permit phishing", "malicious approval", "revoke approvals", "hameçonnage d'approbation", "ubushuhuzi bwa approval", "hadaa ya idhini ya tokeni"], "social", "wallet permission approval warning",
  {"fr": "Phishing d'approbation de jetons", "sw": "Hadaa ya idhini ya tokeni", "rw": "Phishing ya approval ya tokens"},
  "A crypto scam where you are tricked into approving a contract to spend your tokens. The approval looks like a normal click, but afterwards the scammer can empty your wallet without asking again.",
  "Read every wallet pop-up, refuse requests for unlimited approval, check and revoke old approvals regularly with a trusted tool and keep large savings in a separate wallet that never connects to websites.",
  "Arnaque crypto où l'on vous fait approuver un contrat autorisé à dépenser vos jetons. L'approbation ressemble à un clic ordinaire, mais ensuite l'escroc peut vider votre portefeuille sans redemander.",
  "Lisez chaque fenêtre du portefeuille, refusez les demandes d'approbation illimitée, vérifiez et révoquez régulièrement les anciennes approbations avec un outil de confiance et gardez vos économies dans un portefeuille séparé qui ne se connecte jamais aux sites.",
  "Uburiganya bwa crypto aho uyobywa kwemerera contract gukoresha tokens zawe. Kwemera bisa no gukanda bisanzwe, ariko nyuma umutekamutwe ashobora gusiba wallet yawe atongeye kugusaba.",
  "Soma buri idirishya rya wallet, wange ibisabwa bya approval itagira imipaka, ugenzure kandi ukureho approvals za kera buri gihe ukoresheje igikoresho cyizewe, kandi ubike amafaranga menshi muri wallet itandukanye itigera ihuzwa n'imbuga.",
  "Ulaghai wa crypto ambapo unadanganywa kuidhinisha mkataba kutumia tokeni zako. Idhini inaonekana kama bonyezo la kawaida, lakini baadaye tapeli anaweza kumaliza pochi yako bila kuuliza tena.",
  "Soma kila dirisha la pochi, kataa maombi ya idhini isiyo na kikomo, kagua na ubatilishe idhini za zamani mara kwa mara kwa zana inayoaminika na uweke akiba kubwa kwenye pochi tofauti isiyounganishwa na tovuti."),
 ("crypto-mixer", "Crypto mixer (tumbler)", ["crypto mixer", "mixer", "tumbler", "coin mixing", "bitcoin mixer", "money laundering crypto", "mélangeur crypto", "melangeur crypto", "kuvanga crypto", "kuchanganya crypto"], "governance", "blockchain transaction mixing",
  {"fr": "Mélangeur de cryptomonnaies", "sw": "Kichanganyaji cha crypto", "rw": "Igikoresho cyo kuvanga crypto"},
  "A service that mixes many people's coins so the trail between sender and receiver is hard to follow. It is used for privacy but also by criminals to launder stolen money, and some mixers have been sanctioned.",
  "Investigators trace crypto with blockchain analysis, and exchanges flag coins that came from mixers. Receiving coins of unknown origin can freeze your account, so buy only from reputable sources.",
  "Service qui mélange les pièces de nombreuses personnes pour qu'il soit difficile de suivre la trace entre expéditeur et destinataire. Utilisé pour la vie privée mais aussi par des criminels pour blanchir de l'argent volé ; certains mélangeurs ont été sanctionnés.",
  "Les enquêteurs tracent la crypto par l'analyse de blockchain et les plateformes signalent les pièces issues de mélangeurs. Recevoir des pièces d'origine inconnue peut faire geler votre compte : n'achetez qu'auprès de sources fiables.",
  "Serivisi ivanga coins z'abantu benshi ku buryo gukurikirana inzira iva ku wohereje ujya ku wakiriye bigorana. Ikoreshwa ku bw'ibanga ariko n'abagizi ba nabi mu gusukura amafaranga yibwe; bimwe byafatiwe ibihano.",
  "Abashinzwe iperereza bakurikirana crypto bakoresheje blockchain analysis kandi amasoko ashyira ikimenyetso kuri coins ziva muri mixers. Kwakira coins z'inkomoko itazwi bishobora gufunga konti yawe: gura ku masoko yizewe gusa.",
  "Huduma inayochanganya sarafu za watu wengi ili njia kati ya mtumaji na mpokeaji iwe ngumu kufuatilia. Hutumika kwa faragha lakini pia na wahalifu kutakatisha pesa zilizoibwa; baadhi ya mixers zimewekewa vikwazo.",
  "Wachunguzi hufuatilia crypto kwa uchambuzi wa blockchain na majukwaa huweka alama sarafu zinazotoka mixers. Kupokea sarafu za asili isiyojulikana kunaweza kufunga akaunti yako: nunua kutoka vyanzo vya kuaminika tu."),
 ("bridge-hack", "Cross-chain bridge hack", ["bridge hack", "cross-chain bridge", "crypto bridge exploit", "bridge exploit", "piratage de pont", "gutera bridge ya crypto", "udukuzi wa bridge ya crypto"], "attacks", "blockchain bridge connection",
  {"fr": "Piratage de pont inter-chaînes", "sw": "Udukuzi wa daraja la blockchain", "rw": "Igitero kuri bridge ya blockchain"},
  "An attack on a bridge, the service that moves coins from one blockchain to another. Bridges hold large pools of funds, so a flaw in their code or stolen keys can lose hundreds of millions at once.",
  "It shows why code audits, multi-person approval of keys, limits on withdrawals and quick incident response matter. Ordinary users should not keep large amounts in bridge contracts and should prefer well-audited, long-running services.",
  "Attaque contre un pont, le service qui déplace des pièces d'une blockchain à une autre. Les ponts contiennent de grosses réserves de fonds : une faille de code ou des clés volées peut faire perdre des centaines de millions d'un coup.",
  "Cela montre l'importance des audits de code, de l'approbation des clés par plusieurs personnes, des plafonds de retrait et de la réponse rapide aux incidents. Les particuliers ne devraient pas laisser de gros montants dans des contrats de pont et préférer des services audités et établis.",
  "Igitero kuri bridge, serivisi ihindura coins ziva kuri blockchain imwe zijya ku yindi. Bridges zibika amafaranga menshi, bityo intege nke muri code cyangwa imfunguzo zibwe bishobora gutakaza amamiliyoni mu kanya kamwe.",
  "Bigaragaza impamvu gusuzuma code, kwemeza imfunguzo n'abantu benshi, imipaka yo gukuramo n'igisubizo cyihuse ku bitero ari ngombwa. Abakoresha basanzwe ntibagomba kubika amafaranga menshi muri contracts za bridge, bagahitamo serivisi zasuzumwe kandi zimaze igihe.",
  "Shambulio dhidi ya daraja, huduma inayohamisha sarafu kutoka blockchain moja hadi nyingine. Madaraja huhifadhi mabwawa makubwa ya fedha, hivyo dosari ya msimbo au funguo zilizoibwa zinaweza kupoteza mamia ya mamilioni mara moja.",
  "Inaonyesha kwa nini ukaguzi wa msimbo, idhini ya funguo na watu wengi, vikomo vya utoaji na mwitikio wa haraka ni muhimu. Watumiaji wa kawaida wasiweke kiasi kikubwa kwenye mikataba ya madaraja na wapendelee huduma zilizokaguliwa na za muda mrefu."),
 ("blockchain-analysis", "Blockchain analysis", ["blockchain analysis", "chain analysis", "crypto tracing", "crypto forensics", "tracing stolen crypto", "analyse de blockchain", "gukurikirana crypto", "uchambuzi wa blockchain"], "operations", "blockchain transaction tracing graph",
  {"fr": "Analyse de blockchain", "sw": "Uchambuzi wa blockchain", "rw": "Isesengura rya blockchain"},
  "Following the public record of crypto transactions to see where stolen or suspicious coins went, group related wallets and find the exchanges that cashed them out.",
  "Police and companies use it to recover funds and support prosecutions. Public blockchains are not anonymous, they are pseudonymous: once a wallet is linked to a real person, their history becomes visible.",
  "Suivre le registre public des transactions crypto pour voir où sont allées des pièces volées ou suspectes, regrouper les portefeuilles liés et trouver les plateformes qui les ont encaissées.",
  "Police et entreprises l'utilisent pour récupérer des fonds et appuyer des poursuites. Les blockchains publiques ne sont pas anonymes mais pseudonymes : une fois un portefeuille relié à une personne réelle, son historique devient visible.",
  "Gukurikirana inyandiko rusange z'ibikorwa bya crypto kugira ngo ubone aho coins zibwe cyangwa zikemangwa zagiye, ushyire hamwe wallets zifitanye isano ushake amasoko yazikuyemo amafaranga.",
  "Polisi n'ibigo barayikoresha mu kugarura amafaranga no gushyigikira ibirego. Blockchain rusange si anonymous, ni pseudonymous: wallet ihujwe n'umuntu nyakuri amateka ye arigaragaza.",
  "Kufuatilia rekodi ya umma ya miamala ya crypto kuona sarafu zilizoibwa au zenye shaka zilikokwenda, kukusanya pochi zinazohusiana na kutafuta majukwaa yaliyozitoa kuwa fedha.",
  "Polisi na kampuni huitumia kurejesha fedha na kusaidia mashtaka. Blockchain za umma si zisizo na jina, ni zenye jina bandia: pochi ikihusishwa na mtu halisi, historia yake huonekana."),
 ("scam-red-flags", "Red flags of a scam", ["red flags", "red flag", "scam red flags", "warning signs of a scam", "signs of a scam", "how to recognise a scam", "how to spot a scammer", "signes d'arnaque", "signaux d'alerte", "ibimenyetso by'uburiganya", "dalili za utapeli"], "social", "warning signs checklist scam",
  {"fr": "Signaux d'alerte d'une arnaque", "sw": "Dalili za utapeli", "rw": "Ibimenyetso by'uburiganya"},
  "The common warning signs of a scam: urgency, a request for secrets (PIN, OTP, password), a prize or deal that is too good, payment by gift card or mobile money to a stranger, secrecy, threats, a link or number you did not expect, and pressure to skip checking.",
  "One red flag is a reason to stop; several together mean almost certainly a scam. Pause, do not reply, and verify through an official number, app or website that you find yourself, not the ones in the message.",
  "Les signes courants d'arnaque : urgence, demande de secrets (PIN, OTP, mot de passe), gain ou bonne affaire trop beau, paiement par carte cadeau ou argent mobile à un inconnu, secret, menaces, lien ou numéro inattendu et pression pour ne pas vérifier.",
  "Un seul signal est une raison de s'arrêter ; plusieurs ensemble signifient presque sûrement une arnaque. Faites une pause, ne répondez pas et vérifiez via un numéro, une appli ou un site officiel trouvé par vous-même, pas ceux du message.",
  "Ibimenyetso bisanzwe by'uburiganya: kwihutisha, gusaba amabanga (PIN, OTP, ijambo ry'ibanga), igihembo cyangwa amasezerano meza cyane, kwishyura ukoresheje gift card cyangwa mobile money umuntu utazi, ibanga, iterabwoba, link cyangwa nimero utari witeze no gukandamizwa kudagenzura.",
  "Ikimenyetso kimwe ni impamvu yo guhagarara; byinshi hamwe bivuze hafi ya byose ko ari uburiganya. Hagarara, ntusubize kandi ugenzure ukoresheje nimero, porogaramu cyangwa urubuga rwemewe wowe ubwawe wabonye, si izo mu butumwa.",
  "Dalili za kawaida za utapeli: haraka, ombi la siri (PIN, OTP, nenosiri), zawadi au ofa nzuri kupita kiasi, malipo kwa kadi ya zawadi au pesa za simu kwa mgeni, usiri, vitisho, kiungo au namba usiyotarajia na shinikizo la kutohakiki.",
  "Dalili moja ni sababu ya kusimama; kadhaa pamoja humaanisha karibu kwa hakika ni utapeli. Simama, usijibu na uhakiki kwa namba, programu au tovuti rasmi uliyoipata mwenyewe, si zile za ujumbe."),
]
